msgstr ""

#: connie_console/connie_love_join/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her time in the booth was legendary - and she always fought for the rights of human actors over all."
msgstr ""

#: connie_console/connie_love_join/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "One particularly potent social media campaign she led embarrassed the video game industry entirely. Profile pictures were changed at an unprecedented rate - catching the attention of even the sleepiest of executives."
msgstr ""

#: connie_console/connie_love_join/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For it was becoming clear that AI acting, while easy to create and impressive at times, didn't have that lifelike unpredictable spark of play."
msgstr ""

